{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01989",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.64,
      "end_seconds": 3.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Hello, come in. Mind the step."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.24,
      "end_seconds": 5.23,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "hi there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.13,
      "end_seconds": 10.49,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "what would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.72,
      "end_seconds": 14.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I'm here because of itchy raised welts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.04,
      "end_seconds": 19.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.11,
      "end_seconds": 34.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.35,
      "end_seconds": 61.86,
      "duration_seconds": 9.51,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 85, respiratory rate 16, temperature 36.9. And And BP is 113 over 78, saturation 98 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.66,
      "end_seconds": 65.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "is that alright, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.85,
      "end_seconds": 74.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.12,
      "end_seconds": 86.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.92,
      "end_seconds": 92.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "For about a month, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.63,
      "end_seconds": 95.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "What aggravates it, if anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.58,
      "end_seconds": 99.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Stress definitely sets it off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.68,
      "end_seconds": 102.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "sure. Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.88,
      "end_seconds": 130.63,
      "duration_seconds": 26.75,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get poor sleep from itching as well. The poor sleep from itching? That's been for one week. With poor sleep from itching, about a seven out of ten. As for welts that move around, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.98,
      "end_seconds": 137.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Did you get joint pain, throat tightness or difficulty breathing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.56,
      "end_seconds": 141.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "no, none of those at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.09,
      "end_seconds": 145.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "And fever, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.54,
      "end_seconds": 149.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.31,
      "end_seconds": 153.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.79,
      "end_seconds": 157.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Bowels are regular, nothing odd."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.47,
      "end_seconds": 164.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "Anything different when you pass water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.28,
      "end_seconds": 167.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "Nothing there, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.81,
      "end_seconds": 170.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.48,
      "end_seconds": 174.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.5,
      "end_seconds": 178.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Is there any regular medication you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.22,
      "end_seconds": 181.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.15,
      "end_seconds": 188.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.91,
      "end_seconds": 193.82,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "Plasters. I come out in... well, a red itchy rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.48,
      "end_seconds": 198.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.22,
      "end_seconds": 205.42,
      "duration_seconds": 6.2,
      "text": "I've got thin bones. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.02,
      "end_seconds": 211.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.35,
      "end_seconds": 224.87,
      "duration_seconds": 12.52,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.65,
      "end_seconds": 229.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.08,
      "end_seconds": 238.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.16,
      "text": "okay, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.22,
      "end_seconds": 242.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Alright, I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.39,
      "end_seconds": 256.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.55,
      "text": "There are pink raised wheals on the arms and trunk that blanch with pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.39,
      "end_seconds": 262.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "so, you can sit up now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.8,
      "end_seconds": 290.67,
      "duration_seconds": 10.87,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, it points towards chronic spontaneous urticaria. A food reaction is also on my list. I'm going to order blood tests, for chronic urticaria."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 292.1,
      "end_seconds": 297.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "We have a slot Monday at 11:30 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.33,
      "end_seconds": 320.97,
      "duration_seconds": 21.64,
      "text": "We'll begin with fexofenadine, 180 milligrams, once a day, long term. That should help with urticaria. Keep a diary of foods and triggers and avoid hot showers. Please don't wait if you have swelling of the lips with trouble breathing. That's when to be seen urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.59,
      "end_seconds": 328.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Yes, I'll bear that that in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.96,
      "end_seconds": 333.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Right, that's the plan. Do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.96,
      "end_seconds": 339.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.89,
      "end_seconds": 342.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}